omething  about it or they might have a darker  secret  but i don't think we know enough about  their connection to make a good guess at  this point at least i don't have a good  guess at this point  i know richard being the killer is a  thing that's been around since the  beginning  i sort of put him in the red herring  category 2 but i see where people are  coming from thinking he might be  involved  there's also the theory that he's  getting close to mare because he's  writing a book  and there might be something to that we  see them kissing the trailer  so he's not going to fade into the  background even if she does wind up  going for calling in this love triangle  thing that we have going on  and it goes without saying that you  don't hire this guy unless he has some  important role to play in the story  i think that's a good place to leave  things let me know what you think is  going to happen  in the comments please like this video  if you enjoyed it  please subscribe to my channel if you  haven't already i'll be doing two mayor  of east town videos a week from here on  out until the series ends  and thanks for watching i'll talk to you  soon
 

